{"completed": true, "response": "以前和这个人在一起时，他感到很自在，那份快乐是真实的，并不是自己想象出来的安慰。所以，当两人再次亲近起来，他还是会深受触动。他知道自己真正珍惜什么，也正因为如此，那份没说出口的在意并没有因为已经得到满足而变淡，反而变得更加重要。他想再靠近一点，却也记得，一旦说出心意，两人现在的关系可能就会改变。此刻，他既感到满足，也有顾虑，这两种感受同时存在。他的心意再次到了快要说出口的地步，却最终还是没有坦白，也没有做出新的决定。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1955f93f-b768-4513-88b8-5681cbb97c0a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003315793774Z", "elapsed_seconds": 6.594, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:33:22.391831+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3ee7e99c5d2d9bb2e8b7e2f4d5629c1b4a735fd2d9dae1c3f89181ce07a44674", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003315793774Z", "files": ["pr